                                                "sense_id": "fcfaf980-e5de-3c8b-885e-c4468db9b094",
                                                "text": "The reality is that the typical classroom teacher still uses a blackboard and chalk. Indeed, despite the excitement over high-tech devices, most classroom equipment is decidedly low-tech: small-screen television sets, mimeograph machines, monaural phonograph record players, overhead projectors with grease pencils, 16-millimeter projectors, reel-to-reel tape players, filmstrip projectors."
                                            }
                                        ]
